=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}

== Usage ==
'''Frogcoins''' can be thrown in and donated to the {{Zone|Lotus Eater's Cave}}, granting 1 randomly chosen from the buffs, unless they're already active, for {{Green|30}} minutes, while on the [[Lotus Atoll]]:

{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Random Rewards
|-
| {{Stat|Treasure Chance|+1}}
|-
| {{Stat|Trophy Chance|+5}} 
|-
| {{Stat|Scc|+2.5}}
|-
| {{Stat|Fs|+10}} 
|}
While under any of these effects, the players will be able to catch the {{Item|Blessed Frog}} Trophy Frog. Once a {{green|fourth}} one is thrown, the {{NPCSprite|The Lotus Eater}} NPC will appear. Throwing multiple '''Frogcoins''' at the same time will only consume one of them, while the others remain in the water.
Attempting to throw a fifth '''Frogcoin''' does nothing.

